_Royal_Blue_locomotive_-51.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"B&O's first EA model diesel locomotive, No. 51, with the Royal Blue at Camden Station, Baltimore, in 1937","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AB%26O_Royal_Blue_locomotive_-51.jpg"}],"sounds":{}}}